message: "If you use this software, dataset, or research methodology, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Communication Network Analysis of Sarcasm in MBG Discourse: Decoding Emotion Behind the Network"
abstract: "An integrated tri-layer computational communication science study investigating the digital crisis surrounding Indonesia's Free Nutritious Meal (Makan Bergizi Gratis / MBG) program on Platform X. Combines fine-tuned IndoBERT (9 Plutchik emotions), semiotic sarcasm detection, directed Communication Network Analysis (CNA/SNA via NetworkX and Louvain community detection, Q=0.9837), and Aspect-Based Sentiment Analysis (ABSA) demonstrating the Phygital Gap."
